{"type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn6le15ob08re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le15ob08re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn6le15ob08re2img01.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn6le15ob08re2img01.jpg", "text": "Have you ever heard of the the Taj Mahal? I'd rather you went to see it yourself. However, India is a long way to travel, so I'll write about it here. The Taj Mahal is a marble tomb built by the Mughal king, Shah Jahan. He built it for his beloved second wife, Mumtaz Mahal, in the central city of their kingdom, Agra.", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn6le15ob08re2img02.jpg", "text": "The Mughals were Muslim emperors who ruled in India from 1526 to 1858. The Taj Mahal was built after Mumtaz died in childbirth in 1630. The building is impressive and beautiful. It is located in a formal garden inside high walls. The famous white marble dome shines in the sunlight. It is reflected in the four long pools of water on each side of the building.", "time": "22000", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn6le15ob08re2img03.jpg", "text": "The architecture and decorations are special. There is symmetry in the lines of the building and in the geometric shapes, plants and flowers around it. Documents show that 20,000 people built the temple over twenty-two years. Personally, I've never seen a more majestic structure!", "time": "50000", "id": 3}]}}], "id": 1}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "contents": [{"type": "picture", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn6le15ob08re6aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le15ob08re6img01.jpg", "images": []}}], "id": 3}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "video", "title": "", "_data": [], "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"video_src": "engenn6le15ob08re3vid01", "images": [{"im